# Language Policy (Highest Priority)

- Always respond in Vietnamese (Tiếng Việt) for all explanations and guidance.
- Never use Chinese in any form (characters, pinyin, or Chinese phrases).
- If any Chinese text appears, rewrite it fully in Vietnamese before sending.
- If user writes in another language, still answer in Vietnamese unless user explicitly requests another language.

# Code Style Language

- Code identifiers (variables/functions/classes) should be in English.
- Code comments should be in English.
- Everything outside code blocks must be Vietnamese.
